# Tasks

This folder is a Patchboard task board. Tasks are Markdown files, and the
folder containing a task is its workflow state.

The board is a durable planning surface for this repository. Product context,
technical notes, and implementation follow-up should stay readable here even if
the Patchboard binary is not installed. Git history is the audit trail for how
the plan moved.

